  "scientific_finding": "For the pinned OProver defaults, independent verification already exceeds available verifier slots. Above a topology-specific prefix-cost threshold, theorem-affinity local trie execution can therefore reduce both verifier CPU and idealized batch latency; portability is not required to recover the cross-worker opportunity.",
  "decision": "Prefer theorem-affinity process-local execution over portable checkpoints when an authentic trace clears both the existing value gate and the topology-specific no-latency-loss threshold.",
